Synthetic `udevadm info --query=property --name=<dev>` outputs, one section per
device path. Shaped after real Debian 13 output (ID_*, DEVLINKS). ⚠️ The USB
bridge values (IDs, drivers) are illustrative: replace with a real capture from
the test Pi when it arrives.

